+            { title: "USE IT IN NODES", text: "On an ANIM SET node, EDIT opens or creates its animation and ASSET picks which one it uses. Set SELECT to the value holding the row number.\n\nJSR its _sub routine once per frame; a new row starts from its first step automatically. Changes autosave.", targets: [] }
+        ],
