+            { title: "BRING A CHARSET IN", text: "IMPORT loads charset text (.txt), raw binary (.bin, .ctc) or CharPad .ctm files, replacing this one.\n\nOr COPY ROM to start from the 256 built-in C64 characters.", targets: ["IMPORT", "COPY ROM"] },
+            { title: "GROW OR SHRINK IT", text: "[+] ADD ROW appends 16 blank chars, up to 256. [-] REM ROW removes the last 16. Keep only what your game needs - each row is 128 bytes.", targets: ["[+] ADD ROW", "[-] REM ROW"] },
+            { title: "MODE AND COLOURS", text: "The mode button cycles HIRES (one colour per char), MULTICOLOUR (4x8 double-wide pixels, up to four colours) and ECM (four backgrounds, 64 chars only).\n\nThe colour rows below it set BG, FG and the shared colours for that mode. Click a palette swatch to set a colour and paint with it.", targets: ["HR MODE", "MC MODE", "ECM MODE", "@PALETTE", "BG:"] },
